摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Cross-platform Computer Use plugin for DeepSeek Harness: observable desktop automation with an isolated virtual cursor, AX/UIA observation, screenshot vision, and 12 guarded tools.","id":"gh:1335236592","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-computer-use","slug":"988hj7tczd-oss/dsh-computer-use","topics":["ai-agents","ai-computer-use","computer-use","cua-driver","deepseek-harness","desktop-automation","dsh-plugin","linux","macos","mcp","virtual-cursor","windows"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Cross-platform Computer Use plugin for DeepSeek Harness: observable desktop automation with an isola"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ted virtual cursor, AX/UIA observation, screenshot vision, and 12 guarded tools."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-computer-use"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **让 DeepSeek Harness 像人一样操作桌面。** 观察屏幕、定位界面元素、移动独立虚拟光标、点击、输入、滚动和拖拽。\n>\n> **Give DeepSeek Harness a s"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"afe, observable Computer Use layer.** Observe desktop applications, locate UI elements, and act thro"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ugh an isolated virtual cursor."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **真实演示 · Real demo:** a local, non-sensitive page was observed, filled, clicked, and verified thro"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ugh the Computer Use action loop."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**中文文档 · English documentation**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- 中文文档\n- English Documentation"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 生态入口 · Ecosystem"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| 入口 | 作用 | Link |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| **harness-desktop** | 开箱即用的 DeepSeek Harness 桌面客户端 · Ready-to-use desktop client | 下载 / Download |"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"\n| **AI House** | 发现 AI 工具、模型和 Agent · Discover AI tools and agents | 工具中心 / Tools |\n| **npm** | 安装和"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"查看包信息 · Install and inspect the package | dsh-computer-use |\n| **awesome-dsh-plugin** | 发现更多 DeepSee"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"k Harness 插件 · Discover more plugins | Plugin list |\n| **Gitee 镜像** | 国内访问入口 · China mirror | Gitee "},{"id":"p9s5","text":" Harness 插件 · Discover more plugins | Plugin list |\n| **Gitee 镜像** | 国内访问入口 · China mirror | Gitee |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"# 中文文档"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 这是什么？"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"`dsh-computer-use` 是 DeepSeek Harness 的跨平台 Computer Use 插件，为 AI Agent 增加一套可观察、可约束、可验证的桌面操作能力。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 为什么需要它？"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 能力一览"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| 能力 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| 屏幕观察 | 读取目标窗口元数据、Accessibility/AX/UIA 元素和坐标 |\n| 三种观察模式 | `ax` 零视觉 Token、`native` 主模型直读图片、`vision` "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"视觉观察者 |\n| 独立虚拟光标 | 点击、双击、右键会显示虚拟光标移动和操作过程，不抢用户真实鼠标 |\n| 文本与快捷键 | 输入文本、发送 `return`、`cmd+c`、`ctrl+shift"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"+p` 等按键 |\n| 滚动与拖拽 | 支持上下左右滚动和窗口本地截图坐标拖拽 |\n| 应用管理 | 列出运行中的应用，后台启动应用，按需前置窗口 |\n| 安全护栏 | 快照 TTL、应用白名单、危险"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"操作审批、密码框保护 |\n| 跨平台 | macOS 已验证；Windows/Linux 需按真实环境完成平台验收 |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 安全模型"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### 已内置的安全机制"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"1. **无快照拒绝**：没有先调用 `screen_observe`，动作不会执行；\n2. **观察快照 TTL**：快照过期后动作被拒绝，必须重新观察；\n3. **应用白名单**：配置 `allo"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"wedApps` 后，只允许指定应用接受操作；\n4. **危险操作审批**：元素标签命中删除、支付、购买、转账、退出登录等词时请求用户确认；\n5. **密码框保护**：检测到 `AXSecureTex"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"tField` / `AXPasswordField` 时拒绝自动输入；\n6. **键盘前台重试审批**：键盘/文本优先后台投递；只有驱动明确拒绝后台投递并建议前台模式、且当前工具/平台支持时，才请求"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"用户对本次前台重试授权；未获 `allowed-once` 不切换焦点、不重试；\n7. **固定 argv 调用**：通过宿主以非 shell 方式启动 `cua-driver`；\n8. **权限边界"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"声明**：核心桌面路径不读取业务文件或额外凭据；仅当用户配置视觉 GLM fallback 时，才读取指定 key 来源并向 GLM API 发起请求；没有 npm lifecycle 安装脚本。"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### 重要限制"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"语义安全检测依赖观察到的元素标签，主要对 `element` 编号模式有效："},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- `x/y` 坐标模式无法提前知道目标语义，主要依赖快照 TTL 和可见操作；\n- `computer_type` 和 `computer_key` 作用于当前焦点时，无法预判最终目标内容；\n- 驱"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"动拒绝后台键盘/文本投递时，前台重试会先请求本次用户批准；授权后可能切换目标窗口焦点；\n- `computer_key` 不会阻止 `cmd+q`、`ctrl+alt+delete` 等系统快捷键；\n"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"- 不要把本插件的操作权限授予不可信 Agent；\n- 密码、API Key 和其他敏感信息必须由用户本人输入。"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## What is dsh-computer-use?"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"`dsh-computer-use` is a cross-platform Computer Use plugin for DeepSeek Harness. It gives an AI agen"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"t an observable, guarded, and verifiable desktop action layer."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The plugin is designed around an explicit loop:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"It can inspect desktop windows, expose actionable AX/UIA elements, use a screenshot-based visual fal"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"lback, and operate through an isolated virtual cursor. It is useful for desktop automation, Computer"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" Use research, internal workflows, and agentic applications that need bounded desktop actions."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"> This is a community plugin, not an official DeepSeek product and not affiliated with DeepSeek."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Security model"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The plugin includes:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"1. **Observe-before-act**: actions without a fresh observation are rejected;\n2. **Snapshot TTL**: ex"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"pired snapshots require a new observation;\n3. **Application allowlists**: `allowedApps` can restrict"},{"id":"p33s3","text":" the operation scope;\n4. **Risky-action approval**: labels such as delete, pay, purchase, transfer, "},{"id":"p33s4","text":"or sign out can require user approval;\n5. **Password-field protection**: automated typing into passw"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"ord fields is refused;\n6. **Keyboard foreground retry approval**: keyboard/text actions use backgrou"},{"id":"p33s6","text":"nd delivery first; after an explicit driver refusal and only where the driver supports the mode, for"},{"id":"p33s7","text":"eground retry requires one-time user approval. Without approval, focus is not changed and no retry o"},{"id":"p33s8","text":"ccurs;\n7. **Fixed non-shell driver invocation**: the host starts `cua-driver` with fixed argv;\n8. **"},{"id":"p33s9","text":"Explicit permission boundaries**: the core desktop path does not read business files or extra creden"},{"id":"p33s10","text":"tials. The optional GLM fallback reads only its configured key source and sends an HTTPS request to "},{"id":"p33s11","text":"the GLM vision API; there are no npm lifecycle scripts."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Semantic checks are strongest for `element`-based actions. Coordinate actions and unfocused `compute"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"r_type`/`computer_key` calls cannot predict the final semantic target. `computer_key` does not valid"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"ate system shortcuts. Do not give this capability to an untrusted agent, and always type passwords a"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"nd secrets yourself."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"If the driver reports `background_unavailable`, the plugin asks for one-time approval before retryin"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"g in foreground mode where the current tool/platform supports it; that retry may bring the target wi"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"ndow forward. Rejecting or lacking approval leaves the action refused."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
